[{"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "Classroom AI 合成教学示例", "style": "Title", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "23pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "软件工程导论 · 需求到验收的开发流程", "style": "Subtitle", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "15pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "来源：DEMO-DATA-20261012-v1 | 版本：v2 | 日期：2026-10-12", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "9pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "此文件由数据治理脚本生成，用于演示资源、版本与预览功能。课程案例、练习和评价均为合成示例，不是学校正式教学材料、培养方案或真实师生记录。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "学习目标", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "理解课程相关概念，通过可复核案例分析并解释结果；用讨论、实验记录和简要说明展示学习过程。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "案例任务", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "1. 描述一个任务管理工具的使用场景，列出用户目标与约束。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "2. 将场景拆分为三条可检验的需求，给出输入、处理和预期输出。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "3. 用需求、设计、实现和测试四个阶段说明交付路径，记录小组分工。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "新版补充：同组互评两份验收条件，指出边界输入和遗漏步骤，再修订一条测试用例。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "讨论与形成性反馈", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "用需求说明、流程图及测试用例解释方案；讨论隐私保护与版本管理。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "演示反馈口径：概念解释、步骤可复核性、证据与结论的一致性。示例分数不计入任何真实课程成绩。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "使用说明", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "资源标签为理论、讨论或实验、研讨；版本v2保留v1文件。预览与下载由现有账号授权控制。未录制真人、不包含生物识别特征。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/", "type": "footer", "props": {"type": "default", "align": "center", "size": "9pt", "text": "合成示例 · ", "field": "page"}}]